3. **Contradicted & Low Confidence Items:** All 'contradicted' items (the $300k vs $250k-$400k budget disagreement, the workflow vs. platform replacement debate, and the Q3 vs. Q4 timeline clash) as well as the 'low' confidence item (the 60-70% phase 1 asset reusability estimate) are correctly isolated and explicitly addressed in the "Open Questions" section to seek client alignment.
